{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two bandit brothers, One epic heist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two sly siblings, one crazy platforming heist- ready to steal everything that shines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/a2147eb3ea5e2ac6cb8331ad7d1b1f59.poster.avif?t=1762557410\" width=500 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/a2147eb3ea5e2ac6cb8331ad7d1b1f59.webm?t=1762557410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/a2147eb3ea5e2ac6cb8331ad7d1b1f59.mp4?t=1762557410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with two green-skinned burglar brothers on a quest for glittering gold. Switch between the tall, lanky thief to reach elevated platforms, and his short, stocky accomplice to slip under narrow gaps. Only by using their unique shapes together can you collect every shiny treasure, snag the key, and escape to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/bf150e90760d792bed79ae83cbf7d068.poster.avif?t=1762557410\" width=500 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/bf150e90760d792bed79ae83cbf7d068.webm?t=1762557410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542400/extras/bf150e90760d792bed79ae83cbf7d068.mp4?t=1762557410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you cunning enough to clear 40 brain-teasing levels of puzzle-platformer mayhem?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the heist begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes the Megadrive ROM file you can burn and play on your original hardware if you have it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clever 2D puzzle-platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag-team between two distinct thieves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 challenging stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratio modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT Shader option</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/782a6b5b3f6845d70f336addc07642baa9d17e55.jpg"},{"name":"Five-Finger Discount","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/374bb5400d4a74c8e29ba6e22b544f9624e799ce.jpg"},{"name":"Decadent Delinquents","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/28747331c454823cf71f58322323f7deaf44c4d2.jpg"},{"name":"Hotshot Hoarders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/14a10aff8463139033596b1f72bd883990b7bc5c.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Heist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/e0bfe70a010de888b804209eabe0f414f408443d.jpg"},{"name":"Fourt Knox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/b1c67cc4f1f10b68da85e06c36b14b46deb6e68e.jpg"},{"name":"Nine To Shine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3542400/0466eacbd7dc978ae672cd60405521eb58463cec.jpg"},{"name":"Up To Eleven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st